{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3073706105dd81702a356ee48aacb56b05d36b00c7f3d8b8058c720e522349ac","ja":"ねぇ、エレナ。\n今度のクイズ番組の台本、なんだか気にならない？","zh":"呐，艾莲娜。\n下次答题节目的台本，你总觉得有点在意吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"85e161e84ee75a8c01b2ec41d46bc8558afba79ed6efa5e72a2c51ae34545058","ja":"ヒビキも気になったノ！？\nここの部分……。","zh":"响也很在意吗！？\n这个部分……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"65498722d6bdd6bb5b6ec87b63aba1f8bc5e939da21dd6202049b2b372cd352a","ja":"「正解数が一番少ないチームには、\n罰ゲームを受けてもらいます」……って！","zh":"“答对数量最少的队伍，\n要接受惩罚游戏”……居然！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f11cb01d9b26f25ef6ddf30c0503d5e7429b1bffa5763968bbb5dc844216f1b4","ja":"そう、それ！\n罰ゲームって、何をされちゃうんだ！？","zh":"就是那个！\n惩罚游戏到底要做什么啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0e4b279710ab28b130996258ac2463af7dcadef39e1f11a3d442856b4a6a425c","ja":"……もしかして、ワタシがサンバを踊っても\n誰もノッてくれなくてシーンってなっちゃうとか！？","zh":"……难道说，就算我跳起桑巴，\n也没有人跟着嗨起来，反而会变得一片寂静吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"441e39f753655eaa60a7758967f30392264a2743543acd3ec4a4a6ea7bc99106","ja":"自分が編み物をしているときに、\n糸を切られちゃうとかかも！？","zh":"说不定是在自己织毛线的时候，\n毛线会被剪断之类的！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"024f6de14ecaaf99fb0b6d26c8323557eb42c9beb4d56a8d8952708f41165337","ja":"エ～ッ！\nワタシたち、どうなっちゃうノ～！？","zh":"诶～！\n我们接下来会怎么样啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"29decddc7dff096234743d3cd9065c4902efdc3733edb8479a0dc4b91349e699","ja":"うう～。\n想像しただけで、怖くなってきたぞ……。","zh":"呜呜～。\n光是想象一下，就觉得害怕起来了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"769d8cd35f54c69d665e0fb5d3c39bfc6425a8c70790564098fbdbc2a474a306","ja":"あっ！　でも、クイズにたくさん正解したら、\n大丈夫なんだよネ！？","zh":"啊！不过只要答对很多题目，\n就没问题了对吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f16a9776be0b324abb3d4629af4afcf9ef0218de9bb90e621db1f40838498e49","ja":"確かに！　最下位にならなかったらいいんだよね！\nよーし、頑張ろう、エレナ！","zh":"确实！只要不是最后一名就行了吧！\n好～，加油吧，艾琳娜！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1684.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"44be0b5fdff7f5ab833c522d3264a118778509be1c0db87c2f984c416e15dd78","ja":"うん！　絶対に、\n罰ゲームなんて受けないヨ～！","zh":"嗯！绝对\n不会接受什么惩罚游戏的唷～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
